<title>BELGIUM: EU ministers make brief break in lira talks.</title>
<headline>EU ministers make brief break in lira talks.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers and central bank governors called a brief break in the emergency talks aimed at bringing the lira's back into the Exchange Rate Mechanism.</p>
<p>A monetary official said the break started about 1530 GMT and was expected to last for about an hour. No reasons were given for the break.</p>
<p>Earlier, ministers held bilateral and brief multilateral talks, officials said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
